# Domains a child install needs whatever the parent's allow list says: Omarchy
# and Arch updates and mirrors, the AUR, GitHub for themes and migrations,
# time, firmware updates, and the keyserver. Resolves under dns=allowlist in
# addition to /etc/omarchy/parent/dns.allow; a name in dns.deny still wins.
omarchy.org
archlinux.org
pkgbuild.com
github.com
githubusercontent.com
ntp.org
time.cloudflare.com
fwupd.org
openpgp.org
